# SPA fallback: route unmatched URLs to the empty app shell (200.html),
# NOT to /index.html — index.html is the prerendered homepage with the
# home page's title/meta/OG tags baked in. Without this rule, Cloudflare
# Pages' default SPA behavior serves the homepage document for every
# unknown path (soft 404s with the wrong metadata for crawlers).
/* /200.html 200
